+ * argument to the guest's frame() call.
+ *
+ * Adding an argument is deliberately the compatibility-preserving shape:
+ * every existing guest declares frame(buttons, analog, touches, hits) and
+ * simply never looks at the fifth, so no host and no app has to change.
+ *
+ * Bounded and lossy on overflow -- a keyboard cannot outrun a frame, and an
+ * unbounded queue on a 2 GB device is not worth the failure mode.
